  "body": [
    "We create new customer experiences, combining digital content creation, AI and computer vision and advanced edge devices.",
    "Products to explore. Stories to enter. Experiences to live with all the senses, in a space that transforms thanks to AI and allows interaction with its content.",
    "Want to try some devices and technical solutions for yourself? Come visit us in one of the dedicated areas.",
    "The development centre focusing on robotics, advanced mobility and virtual reality.",
    "The Reply Center for next generation Immersive Experiences.",
    "Reply’s laboratory for autonomous operational intelligence.",
    "The leading center for AR and VR – where dedicated technologies are tested and innovative solutions are designed in support of business.",
    "A direct and intuitive experience that shows how the brand’s technologies and digital solutions facilitate work on a farm allowing people to interact with a virtual environment.",
    "Our AI-powered configurator harnesses the capabilities of real-time 3D technologies and Generative AI delivering a competitive advantage for brands.",
    "Reply developed Smart Maintenance: the solution to support and manage maintenance operations and training processes for industry 4.0.",
    "Protocube Reply believes that the value of the technological solution lies in the digital experience, where emotion and engagement play a central role, together with usability and technical innovation.",
    "Reply has developed a holistic view to strategically integrate 3D technologies in the product development process, enhancing the related digital assets and 3D resources within an end-to-end solution.",
    "3D modelling and Generative AI to power Virtual Try-on experiences and produce hyper-realistic images of digital garments, giving customers an immersive and truly valuable experience.",
    "ARIA combines a real-time 3D configurator with a conversational interface, to make the digital experience between a product and its users as natural and straightforward as possible.",
    "This solution makes it possible to centrally manage and remotely control drones and robots (AMRs) from different manufacturers, enabling fully automated data collection and analysis thanks to AI.",
    "Revolutionize your digital presence with AI-powered digital humans: the ultimate solution for human-like interaction at infinite scale.",
    "The report delineates contemporary trends in 3D technology and their impact on reshaping our understanding of reality.",
    "An in-depth look at how consumer 3D scanning is altering the landscape of digital design and creative expression.",
    "Discover also"
  ],
